<title>NETHERLANDS: ING BARINGS RATES VILENZO A BUY.</title>
<headline>ING BARINGS RATES VILENZO A BUY.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of January research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Vilenzo	   textiles	43.00   ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy</p>
<p>Vilenzo at start of period where it should translate</p>
<p>expansion of last five years into profit growth. Shares offer</p>
<p>tremendous upside potential. 12 month price target Dfl 65.00.</p>
